  "decision": "ESCALATE_L2",
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "rationale": "The ownership analysis confirms that Open Joint Stock Company Russian Electronics (OFAC-18770) owns 60% of Orchid Foods Pte Ltd (EXT-0008), which in turn owns 70% of Juniper Software GmbH (CUST-0043). This cascade results in 70% effective ownership by the blocked party, exceeding the 50% threshold. The ownership engine status is 'met' and the chain is within policy limits. No free-text risk signals were found. The alert must be escalated for L2 review.",
  "what_would_change": [
    "If the ownership percentage of Orchid Foods Pte Ltd in Juniper Software GmbH were below 50%, or if the ownership percentage of Russian Electronics in Orchid Foods were below 50%, the threshold would not be met.",
    "If documentary evidence showed the ownership structure has changed since the register data was captured."
  ],
